        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/8e7176ba9dea426e21822fea103953d0.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a world where hope battles against the abyss of catastrophe, and discover a story that could change the fate of the main character.<br>Explore the post-Soviet space, which has turned into a single gloomy place where anomalies violate the laws of physics and reality.|<br><i>The main character, Voila, a stalker with a difficult fate, seeks to unravel the mystery of his wife's disappearance during the Cataclysm.</i><br><br>Gather clues, explore the dark corners of new lands, and uncover mysteries lost among the ruins. Here, in the heart of an abandoned world, you will not only find the answer to the fate of Voyla's wife, but also the way to save other people from the creatures of the Cataclysm.<br><br><strong>«Burned One» — not just a game, but an exploration of the human soul on the brink of survival. In this world full of danger and hope, you will learn to cherish every moment and never lose faith in the possibility of salvation.</strong><br><br>Step into the dark corridors of the post-apocalypse and find out if Voyla will become a guide to the New World...<br><strong><i>...or just another shadow in the ashes of the old...</i></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/94a44ccf7975a066b62e764e96883ae6.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><br>Every step in the New World could be your last. Keep an eye on your surroundings and react as quickly as possible. But... don't make a mistake.  <br><i>You don't want to end up right in the middle of the «Collapse»...</i> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/2b56775c892aa92a02d361cd8c95f322.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><br>There is no black and white in this world. Your decisions affect your relationships with people, and in the future — with factions. One wrong move, and the game will end differently than you expected.  <br>Sometimes helping — means putting yourself in danger.  <br>Betraying — means surviving.  <br><i>And survival — not always a reward. </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/1676a809b1a10e59f15ccda11cdb531b.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><i> </i><br><i></i><br>Every area of the Wastelands holds fragments of the past — diaries, audio recordings, scraps of maps. Collect them to piece together the fate of those who disappeared and uncover what really happened to Voyla's wife.   <br><i>But some truths are better left buried beneath the ruins...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Currently available in the game:<br>5 unique chapters, each of which takes half an hour to complete.<br>4 unique side quests dedicated to various characters of the game.<br>2 mini-side quests with card games, where you can play a game or two with game characters in a fool or 21 points.<br><br>The game has a lot of end-game content, secrets, Easter eggs and just interesting content!</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/8e7176ba9dea426e21822fea103953d0.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a world where hope battles against the abyss of catastrophe, and discover a story that could change the fate of the main character.<br>Explore the post-Soviet space, which has turned into a single gloomy place where anomalies violate the laws of physics and reality.|<br><i>The main character, Voila, a stalker with a difficult fate, seeks to unravel the mystery of his wife's disappearance during the Cataclysm.</i><br><br>Gather clues, explore the dark corners of new lands, and uncover mysteries lost among the ruins. Here, in the heart of an abandoned world, you will not only find the answer to the fate of Voyla's wife, but also the way to save other people from the creatures of the Cataclysm.<br><br><strong>«Burned One» — not just a game, but an exploration of the human soul on the brink of survival. In this world full of danger and hope, you will learn to cherish every moment and never lose faith in the possibility of salvation.</strong><br><br>Step into the dark corridors of the post-apocalypse and find out if Voyla will become a guide to the New World...<br><strong><i>...or just another shadow in the ashes of the old...</i></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/94a44ccf7975a066b62e764e96883ae6.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><br>Every step in the New World could be your last. Keep an eye on your surroundings and react as quickly as possible. But... don't make a mistake.  <br><i>You don't want to end up right in the middle of the «Collapse»...</i> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/2b56775c892aa92a02d361cd8c95f322.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><br>There is no black and white in this world. Your decisions affect your relationships with people, and in the future — with factions. One wrong move, and the game will end differently than you expected.  <br>Sometimes helping — means putting yourself in danger.  <br>Betraying — means surviving.  <br><i>And survival — not always a reward. </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921950/extras/1676a809b1a10e59f15ccda11cdb531b.avif?t=1774351594\" width=636 height=130 /></span><i> </i><br><i></i><br>Every area of the Wastelands holds fragments of the past — diaries, audio recordings, scraps of maps. Collect them to piece together the fate of those who disappeared and uncover what really happened to Voyla's wife.   <br><i>But some truths are better left buried beneath the ruins...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Currently available in the game:<br>5 unique chapters, each of which takes half an hour to complete.<br>4 unique side quests dedicated to various characters of the game.<br>2 mini-side quests with card games, where you can play a game or two with game characters in a fool or 21 points.<br><br>The game has a lot of end-game content, secrets, Easter eggs and just interesting content!</i></p>",
        "short_description": "Visual novel «Burned One» - story that tells about a post-apocalyptic world in post-soviet decorations, and about its people. In the center of the story a stalker Voyla, who trying to find his wife, disappeared during the Cataclysm...",
